<title>MOLDOVA: SOCCER-CONSTRUCTORUL CLINCH MOLDOVAN TITLE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CONSTRUCTORUL CLINCH MOLDOVAN TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Constructorul Chisinau sealed</p>
<p>their first Moldovan championship at the weekend, breaking</p>
<p>capital rivals Zimbru's five-year hold on the title with a</p>
<p>crushing 8-0 victory over Locomotiv Besarabeasca.</p>
<p>Title winners and runners-up since the Moldovan championship</p>
<p>was formed after the collapse of the Soviet Union in 1991:</p>
<p>		Champions			 Runners-up</p>
<p> 1991-92    Zimbru Chisinau		 Tiligul Tiraspol</p>
<p> 1992-93    Zimbru Chisinau		 Tiligul Tiraspol</p>
<p> 1993-94    Zimbru Chisinau		 Tiligul Tiraspol</p>
<p> 1994-95    Zimbru Chisinau		 Tiligul Tiraspol</p>
<p> 1995-96    Zimbru Chisinau		 Tiligul Tiraspol</p>
<p> 1996-97    Constructorul Chisinau     To be decided</p>
<p>No Moldovan club ever won the title in the 55-year history</p>
<p>of the Soviet league from 1936 to 1991.</p>
</text>
